India's GDP growth swung from a 5.8% fall in FY2020-21 to a 9.7% rebound the next year, and has since settled around 6.5% to 9%. These are real growth rates by financial year (April to March), from my memory of the official figures, so check MoSPI for the latest revisions. I've left out FY2025-26 because its final figure may still change.

